{
 "font_size": 0.4,
 "font_color": "#FFFFFF",
 "background_alpha": 0.5,
 "background_color": "#9C27B0",
 "Stroke": "none",
 "type": "AIsubtitle",
 "lang": "zh",
 "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite",
 "body": [
  {
   "content": "我们将讲解如何在游戏中改变方向",
   "from": 7.12,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 1,
   "to": 9.98
  },
  {
   "content": "我的目标是冲到篮筐前沿",
   "from": 9.98,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 2,
   "to": 11.88
  },
  {
   "content": "防守者会试图强行过掉并疯狂对抗",
   "from": 11.88,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 3,
   "to": 15.18
  },
  {
   "content": "不要让对手形成直线下攻路线",
   "from": 15.18,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 4,
   "to": 17.23
  },
  {
   "content": "当这种情况发生时",
   "from": 17.23,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 5,
   "to": 18.47
  },
  {
   "content": "这是我改变方向突破防守的绝佳机会",
   "from": 18.47,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 6,
   "to": 22.07
  },
  {
   "content": "我们还可以先掌握这些动作和细节再深入讲解技巧",
   "from": 22.07,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 7,
   "to": 27.38
  },
  {
   "content": "这三个要素最为关键",
   "from": 27.38,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 8,
   "to": 29.32
  },
  {
   "content": "首先是",
   "from": 29.32,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 9,
   "to": 30.22
  },
  {
   "content": "我们必须具备假动作突破的能力",
   "from": 30.22,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 10,
   "to": 32.439
  },
  {
   "content": "如果你让防守者",
   "from": 32.439,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 11,
   "to": 33.699
  },
  {
   "content": "误以为你在做未实施的动作",
   "from": 33.699,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 12,
   "to": 35.78
  },
  {
   "content": "这样",
   "from": 35.78,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 13,
   "to": 36.1
  },
  {
   "content": "就能占据有利位置操控防守者并改变方向",
   "from": 36.1,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 14,
   "to": 41.95
  },
  {
   "content": "第二点需要良好的持球脚步时机",
   "from": 41.95,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 15,
   "to": 44.49
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我快速启动又能瞬间急停",
   "from": 44.49,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 16,
   "to": 47.15
  },
  {
   "content": "这能为我创造移动空间",
   "from": 47.15,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 17,
   "to": 50.03
  },
  {
   "content": "第三点需要良好的护球能力",
   "from": 50.03,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 18,
   "to": 52.65
  },
  {
   "content": "即使做出精彩动作和脚步",
   "from": 52.65,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 19,
   "to": 54.95
  },
  {
   "content": "但如果球暴露在外",
   "from": 54.95,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 20,
   "to": 57.08
  },
  {
   "content": "位于脚前方位置",
   "from": 57.08,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 21,
   "to": 58.22
  },
  {
   "content": "防守者就能触碰到球",
   "from": 58.22,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 22,
   "to": 59.9
  },
  {
   "content": "然后抢断走掉",
   "from": 59.9,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 23,
   "to": 62.26
  },
  {
   "content": "首先我必须能完成假动作突破",
   "from": 64.22,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 24,
   "to": 66.44
  },
  {
   "content": "当我突破到这里",
   "from": 66.44,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 25,
   "to": 68.36
  },
  {
   "content": "需要快速加速",
   "from": 68.36,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 26,
   "to": 70.43
  },
  {
   "content": "因为要冲击篮筐",
   "from": 70.43,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 27,
   "to": 71.95
  },
  {
   "content": "必须全力冲出去",
   "from": 71.95,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 28,
   "to": 72.75
  },
  {
   "content": "并显得自己正在下坡推进",
   "from": 72.75,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 29,
   "to": 75.19
  },
  {
   "content": "这就是我的首要目标",
   "from": 75.19,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 30,
   "to": 76.21
  },
  {
   "content": "我们必须加速",
   "from": 76.21,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 31,
   "to": 77.3
  },
  {
   "content": "第二点",
   "from": 77.3,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 32,
   "to": 78.22
  },
  {
   "content": "身体要对准篮筐方向",
   "from": 78.22,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 33,
   "to": 80.76
  },
  {
   "content": "当我加速时",
   "from": 80.76,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 34,
   "to": 81.86
  },
  {
   "content": "但转向这个方向",
   "from": 81.86,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 35,
   "to": 83.06
  },
  {
   "content": "即使改变方向",
   "from": 83.06,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 36,
   "to": 85.18
  },
  {
   "content": "他就在那里",
   "from": 85.18,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 37,
   "to": 85.94
  },
  {
   "content": "他静止不动",
   "from": 85.94,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 38,
   "to": 86.62
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我的髋部远离篮筐",
   "from": 86.62,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 39,
   "to": 89.65
  },
  {
   "content": "就无法完成上篮",
   "from": 89.65,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 40,
   "to": 92.03
  },
  {
   "content": "当我启动时",
   "from": 92.03,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 41,
   "to": 93.17
  },
  {
   "content": "开始加速",
   "from": 93.17,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 42,
   "to": 93.89
  },
  {
   "content": "髋部向前",
   "from": 93.89,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 43,
   "to": 94.73
  },
  {
   "content": "但肩膀保持高位",
   "from": 94.73,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 44,
   "to": 96.38
  },
  {
   "content": "无法突破阻力",
   "from": 96.38,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 45,
   "to": 98.28
  },
  {
   "content": "无法滑行过人",
   "from": 98.28,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 46,
   "to": 100.64
  },
  {
   "content": "真正突破时",
   "from": 100.64,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 47,
   "to": 102.22
  },
  {
   "content": "要先贴近防守者",
   "from": 102.22,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 48,
   "to": 103.46
  },
  {
   "content": "在他们靠近前",
   "from": 103.46,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 49,
   "to": 104.47
  },
  {
   "content": "突破阻力的最佳方式",
   "from": 104.47,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 50,
   "to": 106.83
  },
  {
   "content": "实际上要突破到篮下需要低头护肩",
   "from": 106.83,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 51,
   "to": 109.54
  },
  {
   "content": "所以我开始加速",
   "from": 109.54,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 52,
   "to": 110.6
  },
  {
   "content": "我的加速度",
   "from": 110.6,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 53,
   "to": 111.24
  },
  {
   "content": "我的髋部向前",
   "from": 111.24,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 54,
   "to": 112.02
  },
  {
   "content": "然后肩膀要往下往下往下",
   "from": 112.02,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 55,
   "to": 113.54
  },
  {
   "content": "好的",
   "from": 113.54,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 56,
   "to": 113.76
  },
  {
   "content": "嗯",
   "from": 113.76,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 57,
   "to": 113.92
  },
  {
   "content": "然后就是这样",
   "from": 113.92,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 58,
   "to": 114.79
  },
  {
   "content": "然后我可以停止变向",
   "from": 114.79,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 59,
   "to": 116.65
  },
  {
   "content": "这就是我们需要的三点",
   "from": 116.65,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 60,
   "to": 118.41
  },
  {
   "content": "关于突破进攻的应用",
   "from": 118.41,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 61,
   "to": 120.89
  },
  {
   "content": "接下来是球与脚的时机配合",
   "from": 123.76,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 62,
   "to": 125.68
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我从中路突破",
   "from": 125.68,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 63,
   "to": 126.94
  },
  {
   "content": "他过度滑步",
   "from": 126.94,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 64,
   "to": 128.36
  },
  {
   "content": "我可以多次通过减速和停止",
   "from": 128.36,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 65,
   "to": 132.08
  },
  {
   "content": "给他保持过度滑步的时间",
   "from": 132.08,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 66,
   "to": 134.86
  },
  {
   "content": "这为我创造了变向空间",
   "from": 134.86,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 67,
   "to": 137.66
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我突破却无法停下",
   "from": 137.66,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 68,
   "to": 140.5
  },
  {
   "content": "这就是唯一坏处",
   "from": 140.5,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 69,
   "to": 142.06
  },
  {
   "content": "我这样移动",
   "from": 142.06,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 70,
   "to": 142.82
  },
  {
   "content": "我没有真正停下",
   "from": 142.82,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 71,
   "to": 143.9
  },
  {
   "content": "你注意到空间更小",
   "from": 143.9,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 72,
   "to": 146.26
  },
  {
   "content": "我失去平衡且被他压制",
   "from": 146.26,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 73,
   "to": 149.44
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我能到达那个位置",
   "from": 149.44,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 74,
   "to": 150.42
  },
  {
   "content": "我可以加速和减速",
   "from": 150.42,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 75,
   "to": 152.24
  },
  {
   "content": "这给我更多空间",
   "from": 152.24,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 76,
   "to": 153.91
  },
  {
   "content": "更好的平衡",
   "from": 153.91,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 77,
   "to": 155.11
  },
  {
   "content": "更灵活的运球绕过防守者",
   "from": 155.11,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 78,
   "to": 158.13
  },
  {
   "content": "当我决定变向时",
   "from": 158.13,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 79,
   "to": 160.39
  },
  {
   "content": "接下来必须保护好球",
   "from": 162.18,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 80,
   "to": 164.96
  },
  {
   "content": "第一个例子",
   "from": 164.96,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 81,
   "to": 166.44
  },
  {
   "content": "我说突破却被封堵",
   "from": 166.44,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 82,
   "to": 168.02
  },
  {
   "content": "并停止球与脚的时机",
   "from": 168.02,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 83,
   "to": 170.02
  },
  {
   "content": "我在做假突破",
   "from": 170.02,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 84,
   "to": 171.03
  },
  {
   "content": "但当我用陈伟麒运球",
   "from": 171.03,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 85,
   "to": 173.11
  },
  {
   "content": "球在前方",
   "from": 173.11,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 86,
   "to": 174.149
  },
  {
   "content": "现在可以看到他的手紧贴球",
   "from": 174.149,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 87,
   "to": 177.589
  },
  {
   "content": "另外如果我停球并拉回",
   "from": 177.589,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 88,
   "to": 180.51
  },
  {
   "content": "更容易丢球",
   "from": 180.51,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 89,
   "to": 182.91
  },
  {
   "content": "不仅能更好保护球",
   "from": 182.91,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 90,
   "to": 185.23
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我能从这里带球后撤",
   "from": 185.23,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 91,
   "to": 188.61
  },
  {
   "content": "获得更多手部空间",
   "from": 188.61,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 92,
   "to": 190.05
  },
  {
   "content": "B处实际上有更多腿部空间",
   "from": 190.05,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 93,
   "to": 192.86
  },
  {
   "content": "然后第三个关键细节是球回拉保护",
   "from": 192.86,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 94,
   "to": 197.78
  },
  {
   "content": "还能让肩膀转向",
   "from": 197.78,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 95,
   "to": 201.55
  },
  {
   "content": "当我起动时有更好下坡角度",
   "from": 201.55,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 96,
   "to": 203.79
  },
  {
   "content": "这就是第一步做双腿运球",
   "from": 203.79,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 97,
   "to": 207.31
  },
  {
   "content": "保持球后方保护",
   "from": 207.31,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 98,
   "to": 208.85
  },
  {
   "content": "另一个适用场景",
   "from": 208.85,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 99,
   "to": 210.73
  },
  {
   "content": "我说向左突破",
   "from": 210.73,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 100,
   "to": 212.03
  },
  {
   "content": "我用同侧脚观察球的位置",
   "from": 212.03,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 101,
   "to": 215.29
  },
  {
   "content": "他就在那里准备接球",
   "from": 215.29,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 102,
   "to": 216.65
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我们能向后移动",
   "from": 216.65,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 103,
   "to": 217.97
  },
  {
   "content": "我用同侧脚离开",
   "from": 217.97,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 104,
   "to": 219.91
  },
  {
   "content": "注意球几乎被我的髋部护住",
   "from": 219.91,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 105,
   "to": 222.44
  },
  {
   "content": "看看我与他之间的空间",
   "from": 222.44,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 106,
   "to": 224.84
  },
  {
   "content": "现在看那球",
   "from": 224.84,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 107,
   "to": 226.17
  },
  {
   "content": "如果我停下做同样的动作",
   "from": 226.17,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 108,
   "to": 228.11
  },
  {
   "content": "球被回拉并保护好了",
   "from": 228.11,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 109,
   "to": 229.77
  },
  {
   "content": "他伸手够球很积极",
   "from": 229.77,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 110,
   "to": 231.31
  },
  {
   "content": "现在我有了完美变向机会",
   "from": 231.31,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 111,
   "to": 234.49
  },
  {
   "content": "永远不要让球在前方",
   "from": 234.49,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 112,
   "to": 236.35
  },
  {
   "content": "始终让球在身后",
   "from": 236.35,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 113,
   "to": 238.73
  },
  {
   "content": "我们的第一选择要有假动作",
   "from": 241.82,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0,
   "sid": 114,
   "to": 243.66
  },
  {
   "content": "这是一个交叉步",
   "from": 243.66,
   "location": 2,
